    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκβόλ-ιμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thrown out, ejected :</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκβόλιμον</span>”
				<i>abortion,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					575a28
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐ. τῶν ἐμβρύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>PA</u>
					665b1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ᾠῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>GA</u>
					752b4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				464.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>abortive, futile,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				5.29
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.44d
			</span></i> ; <i>to be rejected,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκυρον καὶ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGrenf.</u>
					2.71
				</span></i>
			 ii II <span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
